WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.430
Your dashboard has a brand new look.
Same calls, same inbox.

2
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.690
Everything works exactly like before.

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:14.950
Still, new paint can make a familiar room
feel strange, so where did that button go?

4
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.450
Here's the trick!
Hold Ctrl and Alt and ask me out loud.

5
00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:23.350
On a Mac, it's Ctrl and Option.
Let go when you're done.

6
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.150
“Where do I listen to yesterday's calls?”

7
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.550
I'll answer and point you straight to it.

8
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.050
Still stuck?
Cleo support is right there in the sidebar.

9
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.030
New look, same dashboard.
Just ask!

